  "description": "<p>Voting precicnts for Bell County Texas accounts for the following precinct splits:<\/p><p>Approved in April 2025<\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>315/320 Split \u2013 Split along the City of Temple SMD 1 / SMD 4 line.&nbsp; SMD 4 areas stay in 315, SMD 1 areas make up the new 320.&nbsp; &nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>318/321 Split \u2013 Split along Tarver Drive / Jupiter.&nbsp; The areas south of Tarver / Jupiter stay 318 and the areas north will make up the new 321.<\/span><\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>115/120 Split \u2013 Split along the Belton ISD SMD lines between SMD 1 and SMD 4.&nbsp; SMD 4 area stays 115 and SMD 1 area makes up the new 120.<\/span><\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>210/217 Split \u2013 Split along the Trimmier creek.&nbsp; Areas south of the creek stay as precinct 210.&nbsp; Areas north of the creek are the new 217.<\/span><\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>213/218 Split \u2013 Split along Royal Street, Armstrong, Barnes, and FM 1123.&nbsp; The areas north are saying 213.&nbsp; The areas south are the new 218.<\/span><\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>303/322 Split \u2013 Split along I35.&nbsp; Areas west of I35 remain 303 and areas east of I35 are the new 322.<\/span><\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>408/420 Split \u2013 Split along Stan Schlueter.&nbsp; Areas north of Stan Schlueter remain 408 and areas south are the new 420.<\/span><\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>Approved in December 2023<\/span><\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>101/118 Split \u2013 Split along FM439 to 2271, Streets North of 439 and west of 2271 will become the new 118<\/span><\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>103/119 Split \u2013 Split along west Hwy 190. Streets north of W Hwy 190 will remain in 103. Streets south of 190 will become the new 119<\/span><\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>317/319 Split \u2013 Split along South 31<sup>st<\/sup> street. Streets west of S 31<sup>st<\/sup> will remain in 317. Streets east of S 31<sup>st<\/sup> Street will become the new 319<\/span><\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>Approved in December 2021<\/span><\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>104/115 Split - Split to create NEW Election Precinct 115 (generally bounded by Bonnie then to Richland to FM 2483 along the City of Temple municipal boundary)<\/span><\/p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:11.0pt;'>106/116 Split \u2013 Split along Cedar Hill to Westcliff Rd. to an unnamed boundary east of Caprice Dr. to create NEW Election Precinct 116 for legislative lines<\/span><\/p><p><span>&nbsp;<\/span>117<span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span>- Create NEW Election Precinct 117 near Hays Branch Creek for legislative lines<\/p><p>111/114 Split - Split along US Highway 190 to create NEW Election Precinct 114; the northern portion becomes Election Precinct 114<\/p><p>203/213 Split - Split along I-35 to create NEW Election Precinct 213; the eastern portion becomes Election Precinct 213<\/p><p>204/211 Split - Split the eastern portion to create NEW Election Precinct 211 along Twin Creek Dr.<\/p><p>315/318 Split - Split to create NEW Election Precinct 318 (at Tarver to Pea Ridge to Adams Ave with the southern portion becoming Election Precinct 318)<\/p><p>402/419 Split - Split to create NEW Election Precinct 419 (along Fort Hood Street taking the eastern portion for Election Precinct 419)<\/p>",
